{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48009","headline":"唐晅悼妻诗 二 · 唐晅妻张氏","name":"唐晅悼妻诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常时华堂静，笑语度更筹。\n恍惚人事改，冥寞委荒丘。\n阳原歌薤露，阴壑惜藏舟。\n清夜妆台月，空想画眉愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐晅妻张氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}